<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Glodina yr shr falls sharply, no div.</title>
<headline>Glodina yr shr falls sharply, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr results ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  3.90	  vs 25.21</p>
<p>    - headline		3.65	  vs 22.69</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Income after tax	1.06	  vs 5.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.26	  vs 6.48</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.21	  vs 1.43</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   5.14	  vs 4.28</p>
<p>    Turnover		  100.30	vs 103.55</p>
<p>Full name: Glodina Holdings Limited.</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said trading in the new financial yaer was expected to be stable with the firm regaining the preceding year's profitability.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
